 },
 "check": {
  "describe": "Looks: light and dark page 1 (dark: dark sheet, light text, the illustration slightly dimmed), mono-dark after a swipe to page 2 (white line art on black: mountain crests, the balloon, page 2 text at full contrast, second dot active), mono-light page 3 (black line art on white: moon, stars, tent and flame outlines, an outlined Get started pill). 360x760 light, page 1: blue sky, sun and clouds, pale mountains, green hills, pines and a TRAIL sign; white sheet with Find your trail, two lines, three dots (first blue), Skip and a round blue arrow. drag: 60, 120, 200 px left the pines slide out faster than the mountains, the sky turns violet, the balloon enters, the dot stretches toward the second. release: eases to page 2 (dusk sky, orange sun low behind the balloon, Go further, safely, orange arrow). page 3: night sky with stars and moon, a lit tent and campfire, Sleep under the stars, a full-width violet Get started pill. Dark: the sheet is near-black with light text. Tablet 800x1280 scales text; landscape 760x360 and 1280x800 put the text in a right-hand panel.",
